Each directory contains 37Conf8 structures in xyz XMOL format 
optimized by directory name method.

The 2nd line of each file contains energy of optimized structure
in kcal/mol for MNDO, AM1, RM1, PM3, PM6, PM7, MMFF94 and 
in a.u. for PBEPBE-D3, DFTB3, QM, GFN-xTB, GFN2-xTB.

File 37Conf8_data.xlsx contains absolute and relative SP and OPT conformational
energies as well as dihedral angles.
